# Q21 Are roles permanent types or time-bounded holds? (a party role is a node held from a date, not a subclass of party)
PREFIX party: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/party/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?definition ?note WHERE {
  party:PartyRole skos:definition ?definition ; skos:scopeNote ?note .
  party:validFrom rdfs:range <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { party:PartyRole rdfs:subClassOf* party:Party }
}
